        <ExplanationTxt>THE ADMINISTRATIVE OFFICE REVIEWS THE FORM 990 AND WILL NOTIFY THE BOARD OF TRUSTEES IF ANY UNUSUAL OR SIGNIFICANT ITEMS ARE NOTED. FORM 990 IS DISTRIBUTED TO AN AUTHORIZED TRUSTEE OF THE PLAN FOR REVIEW AND APPROVAL BEFORE IT WAS FILED.</ExplanationTxt>
